[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Expanding both squares, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \cos^2 x + \cos^2 y + \cos^2 z + 2(\cos x \cos y + \cos y \cos z + \cos z \cos x) + (\sin^2 x + \sin^2 y + \sin^2 z + 2(\sin x \sin y + \sin y \sin z + \sin z \sin x)) = 0
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Using the Pythagorean identity \(\sin^2 \theta + \cos^2 \theta = 1\) and the addition formulas \(\cos(x+y) = \cos x \cos y - \sin x \sin y\) and \(\cos(x-y) = \cos x \cos y + \sin x \sin y\), we get:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 1 + 1 + 2(\cos x \cos y + \sin x \sin y) + 2(\sin x \sin y + \cos x \cos y) = 0
