[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Rearranging the terms, we get a quadratic equation in \(\sin 2x\):
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
