[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Using the double-angle identity \(\sin 2x = 2 \sin x \cos x\), we can rewrite the equation as:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m -19 \sin^2 x - 8 \cos x \sin x + 1 = 0
