[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m This is a quadratic equation in \(\sin 2x\). We can solve it using the quadratic formula \(\sin 2x = \frac{-b \pm \sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a}\), where \(a = 19\), \(b = 8 \cos x\), and \(c = -1\). Substituting these values in, we get:
