[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Since \(\angle CED" = \angle ECO" = 21.5^\circ\) (because \(\angle ECO\) in the excentric division of \(\angle EAO\) by the right angle at \(O\)), we have:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \angle CED = 360^\circ - 42^\circ = 318^\circ.
