[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Subtract 10 from both sides to set the equation to zero:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m -10t^2 - 23t + 10 = 0
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
