[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 10t^2 + 23t - 10 = 0
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m We solve this quadratic equation for \( t \) using the quadratic formula:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
