[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Finally, we find the angle \(\theta\) by taking the inverse cosine (arccos) of \(-\frac{1}{2}\):
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
