[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 3. **Conclusion:**
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m    The area of the square is \(\boxed{3}\).<|im_end|>
