[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m So, we have the quadratic factor \(-(1 - 2)(1 + 2) = -3\). Now, we factor the remaining polynomial \(1 - 2\):
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[1 - 2 = -1.\]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Thus, the entire expression can be written as:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[(x - 1)(x + 1) \cdot (-1) = -(x - 1)(x + 1).\]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
