[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m To find the probability that all three cards drawn from a standard deck are hearts, we start by determining the total number of ways to draw all three cards from the deck. The deck contains 52 cards, and we need to choose one card from each suit (hearts, diamonds, clubs, and spades).
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
