[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m The absolute value of this expression is:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ \left| -1 + \frac{\sqrt{3}}{4} \right| = \left| \frac{4 - \sqrt{3}}{4} \right| = \frac{\sqrt{3} - 4}{4}. \]
