[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m    - \(a \in \{5, 9\}\)
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m    - \(a \geq 9\)
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m    - No need to check bases above 9 because \(5 \cdot 4 \leq 100\)
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 6. **Check each square-free odd integer of the form \(a^2 + b \cdot 4\):**
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m    - \(5^2 + 4 \cdot 4 = 25 + 16 = 41\)
