[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m The maximum value of \(c\) occurs when one of the variables is at its extreme values, or trying \(a\) or \(b = \frac{2}{3}\):
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
