[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m A divisor of 252 will have the form \(2^a \cdot 3^b \cdot 7^c\) where \(0 \le a \le 2\), \(0 \le b \le 2\), and \(0 \le c \le 1\). For the divisor to be even, \(c\) must be 0. So the possible forms of the divisor are:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
