[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ x =- 3\] because \(x^2 -2 x \geq 0\).
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[\sqrt{3} - \sqrt{3}=0.\]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
