[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \frac{1}{243} = \frac{1}{243}
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Now we can substitute these fractions back into the original expression:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \frac{1}{3} - \frac{1}{9} + \frac{1}{27} - \frac{1}{81} + \frac{1}{243} = \frac{81}{243} - \frac{27}{243} + \frac{9}{243} - \frac{3}{243} + \frac{1}{243}
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Next, we combine the numerators over the common denominator:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
