[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[9 + 9 = 18.\]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m The units digit of \(18\) is 8. Therefore, the units digit of \(19^{19} + 99^{99}\) is \(\boxed{8}\).<|im_end|>
