[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 7 = x^2 + \frac{1}{x^2} \implies \left(x + \frac{1}{x}\right)^2 = 7
