[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Next, we determine the number of divisors of \( n \):
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 31 + 1 = 32 \quad \text{and} \quad 19 + 1 = 20
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Thus, the number of divisors of \( n \) is:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
