[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m The expression \( -3k^2 + 3k - 1 \) is always negative when \( k \) is an integer. Therefore:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m n \equiv -1 \pmod{k}
