[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m To solve the problem, we need to evaluate the functions step by step, starting from inside the parentheses and working outward. The functions given are \( N(x) = 2\sqrt{x} \) and \( O(x) = x^2 \).
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m First, we evaluate \( N(O(3)) \):
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ O(3) = 3^2 = 9 \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ N(9) = 2\sqrt{9} = 2 \cdot 3 = 6 \]
