[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Next, we evaluate \( O(N(O(3))) \):
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ N(O(3)) = 6 \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ O(6) = 6^2 = 36 \]
