[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m So, we have \( N(O(O(3))) = 72 \).
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Finally, we evaluate \( N(O(N(O(O(3))))) \):
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ N(O(N(O(O(3))))) = N(72) = 2\sqrt{72} = 2 \cdot 8 = 16 \]
