[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \mathbf{R} = \frac{1}{1^2 + 5^2} \begin{pmatrix} 1^2 & 2 \cdot 5 \cdot 1 \\ 2 \cdot 5 \cdot 1 & 5^2 \end{pmatrix} = \frac{1}{1 + 25} \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 10 \\ 10 & 25 \end{pmatrix} = \frac{1}{26} \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 10 \\ 10 & 25 \end{pmatrix}
