[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m The determinant of a 2x2 matrix \(\begin{pmatrix} a & b \\ c & d \end{pmatrix}\) is given by \(ad - bc\). Therefore, the determinant of \(\mathbf{R}\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
