[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Dividing both sides by 2, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 5ab = (a + b)^2
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Rewriting the right side, we have:
