[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ n + (n+2) + (n+4) = 3n + 6 \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m According to the problem, the product is twenty times the sum, so we set up the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ n(n+2)(n+4) = 20(3n + 6) \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Expanding both sides, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
