[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Rearranging all terms to one side of the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ n^3 + 6n^2 + 8n - 60n - 120 = 0 \]
