[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m   \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m **Step 2: Determine the angle between the hour hand and the minute hand.**
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m The angle between the hour hand at 24.5 degrees and the minute hand at 25.18 degrees is:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m |25.18 - 24.5| = 0.68 \text{ degrees}
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m **Step 3: Ensure the angle is acute and at least 0 degrees.**
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
