[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m which is not necessarily true, but still valid, suggesting we should work directly with \(\tan \theta \sec \theta = 1\). The equation \(A \tan \theta + B \sec \theta = C\) gives us \(A = 1\), \(B = 0\), and \(C = 1\). For the given expression, we need:
