[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Similarly,
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \frac{1 - \sin \theta}{1 + \sin \theta} = \frac{(1 + \sin \theta)^2}{(1 - \sin \theta)(1 + \sin \theta)} = \frac{10 \sin \theta}{1 - \sin^2 \theta} = \frac{10 \sin \theta / \cos^2 \theta}{\cos^2 \theta} = \frac{10 \frac{\sin \theta}{\cos \theta}}{\cos^2 \theta} = \frac{10}{\cos^2 \theta}.
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Thus,
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \frac{1 + \sin \theta}{1 - \sin \theta} - \frac{1 - \sin \theta}{1 + \sin \theta} = \frac{\frac{(1 + \sin \theta)^2}{\cos^2 \theta} - \frac{10}{\cos^2 \theta}}{\frac{1 - \sin^2 \theta}{\cos^2 \theta}} = \frac{\frac{(1 + \sin \theta)^2 - 10}{\cos^2 \theta}}{\frac{1 - \sin^2 \theta}{\cos^2 \theta}} = \frac{(1 + \sin \theta)^2 - 10}{1 - \sin^2 \theta} = \frac{(\sin \theta + 1)^2 - 10}{\cos^2 \theta} = \frac{\sin^2 \theta + 2 \sin \theta + 1 - 10}{\cos^2 \theta} = \frac{\sin^2 \theta + 2 \sin \theta - 9}{\cos^2 \theta} = -9.
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Thus, the value is \(\boxed{-9}\).<|im_end|>
