[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m This is a quadratic equation in the standard form \( P = -x^2 + 1998x \), which is a downward-opening parabola. The maximum value of a quadratic function \( ax^2 + bx + c \) occurs at \( x = -\frac{b}{2a} \).
