[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 2^{1995} \equiv 2^0 \equiv 1 \pmod{7}
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Thus, the remainder when \(9^{1995}\) is divided by 7 is \(\boxed{1}\).<|im_end|>
