[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m To determine the average of all integer values of \( M \) such that \(\frac{M}{56}\) is strictly between \(\frac{3}{7}\) and \(\frac{1}{4}\), we start by setting up the inequality:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
