[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ \sum_{1 \leq x < y \leq 100} \left( \frac{x}{4} \cdot \frac{y}{4} \right) \binom{4}{x,y} = \sum_{x=1}^{99} \sum_{y=x+1}^{99} \left( \frac{x}{4} \cdot \frac{y}{4} \right) \binom{4}{x,y} = 99 \cdot \left( \frac{100 \cdot 99}{4 \cdot 3 \cdot 2} \cdot \binom{2}{1,1} + \frac{99 \cdot 101}{4 \cdot 3 \cdot 2} \cdot \binom{2}{2} + \frac{98 \cdot 99}{4 \cdot 3 \cdot 2} \cdot \binom{2}{3} \right) = \frac{99}{2} \left( \binom{2}{1,1} + \binom{2}{2} + \binom{2}{3} \right) = \frac{99}{2} \cdot 3 = \frac{297}{2} = 148.5 \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
