[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 8 + 10 > 6 \implies 18 > 6 \quad \text{(true)}
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Since all these conditions are satisfied, the sides 6 cm, 8 cm, and 10 cm can form a triangle. The remaining side is the third side, which is 6 cm, so the shortest possible length of the remaining side is:
