[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \begin{pmatrix} 6 \\ -5 \end{pmatrix}^2 \leq k \begin{pmatrix} -3 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix}^2
