[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Here, \(\begin{pmatrix} 6 \\ -5 \end{pmatrix}\) is a unit vector and \(\begin{pmatrix} -3 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix}\) is a unit vector. The magnitudes are:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \begin{pmatrix} 6 \\ -5 \end{pmatrix} = \sqrt{6^2 + (-5)^2} = \sqrt{36 + 25} = \sqrt{61},
