[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m So the inequality becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \begin{pmatrix} 6 \\ -5 \end{pmatrix} \cdot (k \begin{pmatrix} -3 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix}) \leq k^2.
