[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m This can be rewritten as:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m k^2 + 23k \geq 0,
