[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ a - \frac{-2a}{2a} = a + 1 = -2a. \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Solving for \(a\), we get:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ a + 1 = -2a \implies a = -1. \]
