[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ c = 0. \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Thus, the quadratic function is:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ y = -x^2 + 2x. \]
