[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ a_3 = a_1 + 2d = 5 \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ a_6 = a_1 + 5d = -1 \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m We now have a system of linear equations:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 1. \(a_1 + 2d = 5\)
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 2. \(a_1 + 5d = -1\)
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m To eliminate \(a_1\), we subtract the first equation from the second:
