[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m This simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 10(x - \text{GCD}(10, x)) = 70
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Dividing both sides by 10, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
