[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Let \( d = \text{GCD}(10, x) \). Then \( d \) must divide 10, so the possible values for \( d \) are 1 and 2, and 5 (since 10 could also divide \( x \)). Let's consider the cases:
