[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Subtract \( y + 6 \) from both sides, which leaves us with:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
