[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \log_{81} (2r-1) = -\frac{1}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m we can rewrite this as:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 81^{-\frac{1}{2}} = 2r-1
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Next, we need to simplify \(81^{-\frac{1}{2}}\). Since \(81 = 3^4\), we have:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 81^{-\frac{1}{2}} = (3^4)^{-\frac{1}{2}} = 3^{4 \cdot -\frac{1}{2}} = 3^{-2} = \frac{1}{9}
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
