[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m To determine how many possible combinations Jason can try given the constraints, we need to carefully consider the requirements: every even digit must be followed by an odd digit, and every odd digit must be followed by an even digit. This means that the digits must alternate in the pattern of odd-even-odd, and every type of digit should appear an equal number of times.
