[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m To solve the given problem, we need to evaluate the expression 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m $$\sum_{k=1}^{1000} k(\lceil \log_{\sqrt{2}}{k}\rceil - \lfloor \log_{\sqrt{2}}{k}\rfloor).$$
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m First, let's analyze the expression inside the summation: 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \lceil \log_{\sqrt{2}}{k}\rceil - \lfloor \log_{\sqrt{2}}{k}\rfloor
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m The ceiling function, \(\lceil x \rceil\), returns the smallest integer greater than or equal to \(x\), and the floor function, \(\lfloor x \rfloor\), returns the largest integer less than or equal to \(x\). Therefore, 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \lceil \log_{\sqrt{2}}{k}\rceil - \lfloor \log_{\sqrt{2}}{k}\rfloor = \begin{cases} 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \log_{\sqrt{2}}{k} & \text{if } \log_{\sqrt{2}}{k} \text{ is an integer} \\
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 1 & \text{if } \log_{\sqrt{2}}{k} \text{ is not an integer and } k \text{ is odd} \\
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 0 & \text{if } \log_{\sqrt{2}}{k} \text{ is not an integer and } k \text{ is even} 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \end{cases}
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Given \(k = 2n(1 - \sqrt{2})\) where \(n\) is a non-negative integer (since \(k\) is an integer), we know that \(\frac{k}{\sqrt{2}}\) is a real number and \(\lfloor \log_{\sqrt{2}}{k} \rfloor = 0\). This means that for any \(n\):
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \log_{\sqrt{2}}{k} = \log_{\sqrt{2}}{(2n(1 - \sqrt{2}))} = \log_{\sqrt{2}}{2} + \log_{\sqrt{2}}{(n(1 - \sqrt{2}))} = 1 + \log_{\sqrt{2}}{\left(\frac{n}{2}\right)}
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m The ceiling and floor functions will then be:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \lceil \log_{\sqrt{2}}{k} \rceil = 1 + \left\lfloor \log_{\sqrt{2}}{\left(\frac{n}{2}\right)} \right\rfloor = 1 + \left\lfloor 1 + \log_{\sqrt{2}}{\left(\frac{n}{2}\right)} \right\rfloor = 1 + 1 + \begin{cases} 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \lfloor \log_{\sqrt{2}}{\left(\frac{n}{2}\right)} \rfloor & \text{if } \log_{\sqrt{2}}{\left(\frac{n}{2}\right)} \text{ is an integer} \\
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 2 & \text{if } \log_{\sqrt{2}}{\left(\frac{n}{2}\right)} \text{ is not an integer and } n \text{ is even} \\
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 0 & \text{if } \log_{\sqrt{2}}{\left(\frac{n}{2}\right)} \text{ is not an integer and } n \text{ is odd} 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \end{cases}
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m So, 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \lceil \log_{\sqrt{2}}{k} \rceil = 2
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m and 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \lfloor \log_{\sqrt{2}}{k} \rfloor = 0
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Thus, the expression simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \lceil \log_{\sqrt{2}}{k} \rceil - \lfloor \log_{\sqrt{2}}{k} \rfloor = 1
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Therefore, the entire summation becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \sum_{k=1}^{1000} 1 = 1000
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m So, the final answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \boxed{1000}
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]<|im_end|>
