[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ d + 60 = 105 \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ d = 45 \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m So, Paula has 95 - 5 - 45 = 45 dimes. Therefore, the number of dimes Paula has is:
