[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m The students in Mrs. Reed's English class are reading the same $760$-page novel. Three friends, Alice, Bob and Chandra, are in the class. Alice reads a page in $20$ seconds, Bob reads a page in $45$ seconds and Chandra reads a page in $30$ seconds.   Chandra and Bob, who each have a copy of the book, decide that they can save time by `team reading' the novel. In this scheme, Chandra will read from page $1$ to a certain page and Bob will read from the next page through page $760,$ finishing the book. When they are through they will tell each other about the part they read. What is the last page that Chandra should read so that she and Bob spend the same amount of time reading the novel?
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m To determine the last page that Chandra should read so that she and Bob spend the same amount of time reading the novel, we need to calculate the total time each of them spends reading and set these times equal to each other.
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m First, let's calculate the total reading time for Chandra:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m - Chandra reads from page 1 to page 760. Therefore, the total number of pages Chandra reads is:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m   \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m   760 - 1 = 759
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m   \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m - Chandra's reading time is:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m   \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m   759 \times 30 = 22770 \text{ seconds}
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m   \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m   Converting seconds to hours:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m   \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m   22770 \div 3600 = 6.2317 \text{ hours}
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m   \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Next, let's calculate the total reading time for Bob:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m - Bob reads from page 2 to page 760. Therefore, the total number of pages Bob reads is:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m   \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m   760 - 2 = 758
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m   \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m - Bob's reading time is:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m   \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m   758 \times 45 = 33410 \text{ seconds}
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m   \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m   Converting seconds to hours:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m   \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m   33410 \div 3600 = 9.375 \text{ hours}
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m   \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Since Chandra and Bob spend the same amount of time working together, their combined reading times should be equal:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 22770 + 33410 = 56180 \text{ seconds}
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Converting seconds to hours:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 56180 \div 3600 = 15.025 \text{ hours}
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Let's denote the last page Chandra should read as \( p \). Thus, Chandra's reading time becomes:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m (759 - 1)(p) = 15.025(p) = p + 750
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Solving for \( p \):
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 759p = p + 750 \implies 759p - p = 750 \implies 758p = 750 \implies p = \frac{750}{758} \approx 0.986 \text{ pages}
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m However, since each page can only be divided, and considering rounding:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m p \approx 0.99 \text{ pages equivalent to 8}
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Therefore, the last page Chandra should read is:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \boxed{8}
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]<|im_end|>
