[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m In $\triangle ABC$ points $D$ and $E$ lie on $\overline{BC}$ and $\overline{AC}$, respectively.  If $\overline{AD}$ and $\overline{BE}$ intersect at $T$ so that $AT/DT=3$ and $BT/ET=4$, what is $CD/BD$?
