[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m To determine the probability that Melinda will be able to form a two-digit number between 10 and 20 when rolling two standard six-sided dice, we need to follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 1. **Identify the total number of possible outcomes when rolling two dice:**
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m    Each die has 6 faces, so the total number of possible outcomes is:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m    \[
