[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Given that \( V^2_1 = 26 \), \( V \) must be an integer. The possible values for \( V \) are \( 2 \) and \( -2 \). Since \( V \) represents the cost for each extra hour, we need to check which scenario fits the equation.
