[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m The Lucas sequence is the sequence 1, 3, 4, 7, 11, $\ldots$ where the first term is 1, the second term is 3 and each term after that is the sum of the previous two terms. What is the remainder when the $100^{\mathrm{th}}$ term of the sequence is divided by 8?
