[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 2. **Placing the Cut:** When we cut the cube, we are cutting through the four vertices of the cube directly above the chosen corner. The cut is a face of the cube that extends through the centers of three of these four vertices. The cut divides the cube into four triangular faces.
