[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Next, we need to find \(\sin 2\theta\). Using the identity \(\sin^2 2\theta = 1 - \cos^2 2\theta\), we get:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
