[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Thus, the value of \(\tan^2 \theta \tan^2 3\theta\) is:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
