[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m This means \(2^{1993} \equiv 2^1 \equiv 2 \pmod{5}\).
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Next, we find the pattern of the units digits of \(3^n\) modulo 5:
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \begin{align*}
