[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m or mathematically,
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ a = k \frac{1}{b^2} \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m where \(k\) is a constant.
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m We are given that \(a = 9\) when \(b = 2\). Using this information, we can find the value of \(k\):
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ 9 = k \frac{1}{2^2} \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ 9 = k \frac{1}{4} \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ k = 9 \times 4 \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ k = 36 \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m Now that we have the constant \(k\), we can find the value of \(a\) when \(b = 3\). Using the relationship \(a = \frac{1}{b^2}\) with \(b = 3\):
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ a = \frac{1}{3^2} \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ a = \frac{1}{9} \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m \[ a = \frac{1}{3^2} \]
[36m(main_task pid=3409)[0m 
